          '📅 Step 1: Schedule your Discovery Call using the calendar below. In this session, we’ll review your business goals and walk you through how to launch your reseller agency.',
      },
      {
        description:
          '📝 Step 2: Check your email — you’ll receive a short form to share your agency details such as name, focus, and branding preferences. Please complete it before our call.',
